# Without this, Git's autocrlf line-ending normalization would treat *.pdf as a text file and
# rewrite LF bytes to CRLF wherever they happen to occur in the binary content — silently
# corrupting the file (PDF's xref table depends on exact byte offsets). Mark every binary asset
# explicitly as binary so Git never diffs or converts it.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
